{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghoYW3DdaRYkxocyTJed","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Result:** Dq ≈ 1 040 cm⁻¹ and B ≈ 820 cm⁻¹. These come from a high-spin d⁷ (Co²⁺-type) fit, and I did not fit C.\n\n**Assignment.** The three spin-allowed bands of a high-spin octahedral d⁷ ion are:\n- ν₁ = ⁴T₁g(F) → ⁴T₂g(F) = 9 180 cm⁻¹\n- ν₂ = ⁴T₁g(F) → ⁴A₂g(F) = 19 550 cm⁻¹\n- ν₃ = ⁴T₁g(F) → ⁴T₁g(P) = 20 320 cm⁻¹\n\nThe two bands near 20 000 cm⁻¹ are unusually close together. The fit below shows they are consistent with ν₂ and ν₃ of the same ion.\n\n**Energy expressions.** Take the ⁴F barycentre as zero. The ⁴T₂g(F) state lies at +2Dq and ⁴A₂g(F) at +12Dq. The two ⁴T₁g states mix through the 2×2 matrix\n\n[[12B + 2Dq, 6B], [6B, 3B − 8Dq]]\n\nCall its eigenvalues E₋ (the ground state) and E₊ (⁴T₁g(P)). This matrix is built by analogy with the d³ case with Dq → −Dq, and I checked it against the Dq = 0 limit. The transition energies are then:\n- ν₁ = 2Dq − E₋\n- ν₂ = 12Dq − E₋\n- ν₃ = E₊ − E₋\n\n**Solving.**\n1. Subtracting the first two expressions gives ν₂ − ν₁ = 10Dq. So 10Dq = 19 550 − 9 180 = 10 370, and Dq ≈ 1 037 cm⁻¹.\n2. Substituting Dq into ν₁ = 9 180 and solving the quadratic for E₋ gives B ≈ 824 cm⁻¹.\n3. Check: the predicted ν₃ is about 20 343 cm⁻¹, against 20 320 cm⁻¹ observed. The fit is self-consistent.\n\nFor comparison, the free-ion B for Co²⁺ is about 970 cm⁻¹. The fitted value of about 0.85 of that is a reasonable nephelauxetic reduction.\n\n**C.** The three spin-allowed bands do not depend on C. It is only accessible from spin-forbidden transitions, so it cannot be determined here.\n\n{\"Dq\": 1037, \"B\": 824, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"High-spin d7 fit with ν1=4T2g, ν2=4A2g, ν3=4T1g(P) is self-consistent (ν3 calc 20343 vs 20320); C is not determinable from spin-allowed bands.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":806,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"704ba130-4040-4474-ad6b-586f21d8e839","uuid":"2be16caf-6373-4cd6-b4b8-955bef8738d2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T11:24:59.067Z","request_id":"req_011CghoYVcfDEU66rK91MptG"}
